<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 440)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Aspect guides now work in side-by-side and stacked compares</b>: every picture carries its own guide set (and gate outline), measured from that picture's extent — they previously drew across the whole viewport as if a single full frame were there.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
